 "Much lighter than Neo4j; no separate container required."}}, {"id": "archivum_prd_v1_0_docker_compose", "label": "Docker Compose Stack", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "archivum-prd-v1.0.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "attributes": {"network": "wiki-net bridge network (archivum-net in security section)", "services": ["Web UI", "REST API", "MCP Server", "Wiki Agent", "Qdrant", "Neo4j"], "storage": "named Docker volumes \u2014 survives restarts and upgrades", "multi_tenancy_prep": "wiki_id field on all data models from day 1", "rationale": "Single docker compose up with zero manual steps beyond .env is the deployment goal. wiki_id on all models from day 1 ensures future multi-tenancy without a rewrite."}}, {"id": "archivum_prd_v1_0_markdown_canonical", "label": "Markdown as Canonical Format", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "archivum-prd-v1.0.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "attributes": {"rationale": "Markdown files are canonical; Qdrant and Neo4j are derived and fully rebuildable from them. This makes the system resilient \u2014 indexes can always be regenerated from the source-of-truth files."}}, {"id": "archivum_prd_v1_0_graph_view", "label": "Graph View", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "archivum-prd-v1.0.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 Epic 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "attributes": {"renderer_options": ["vis.js", "Sigma.js"], "backed_by": "Neo4j", "node_types": ["page", "person", "concept", "organisation"], "edge_types": ["references", "related-to", "contradicts", "mentions"], "update_latency": "within 5 seconds of new ingest completing", "risk": "first item cut if timeline is tight"}}, {"id": "archivum_prd_v1_0_query_engine", "label": "Query Engine", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "archivum-prd-v1.0.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 Epic 4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "attributes": {"approach": "Qdrant semantic + Neo4j multi-hop + LLM synthesis + streaming SSE", "first_token_latency": "under 3 seconds", "citations": "linked to specific wiki pages", "save_answer": "Save as page button creates new wiki page indexed in Qdrant and Neo4j"}}, {"id": "archivum_prd_v1_0_semantic_search", "label": "Semantic Search", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "archivum-prd-v1.0.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 Epic 5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "attributes": {"backed_by": "Qdrant vector similarity", "latency": "under 1 second", "fallback": "keyword search if vector results are sparse"}}, {"id": "archivum_prd_v1_0_security_model", "label": "Security Architecture", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "archivum-prd-v1.0.md", "source_location": "\u00a710", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "attributes": {"access_layers": ["Tailscale network (full auth access)", "Cloudflare Tunnel (public share links, read-only, token-gated)", "LAN direct (full access on home network)"], "auth_methods": ["Password login (owner)", "Invite token", "Share token", "OAuth/SSO (future)"], "session_tokens": "Short-lived JWTs (15 min) + refresh tokens (7 day), httpOnly SameSite=Strict cookies", "password_hashing": "bcrypt cost factor 12, min 12 chars", "tls": "Caddy reverse proxy with auto TLS", "markdown_sanitisation": "DOMPurify (client) + bleach (server) \u2014 critical control", "non_root_containers": true, "db_isolation": "Qdrant and Neo4j ports not exposed to host by default", "rationale": "No public port exposed directly. Tailscale for trusted access, Cloudflare Tunnel for share links only. /raw volume mounted read-only to all services except ingest pipeline to prevent source overwrite by bugs or compromised services."}}, {"id": "archivum_prd_v1_0_share_links",